    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Deliberately carries no POLICE lettering, force crest or registration plate.. Panel gaps, glazing, lamp lenses, wheel arches and the underside floorpan are all modelled, and the top and bottom views confirm a closed body with no missing faces. No brand badge, wordmark or number plate appears anywhere.",
    "limitations": [
      "Stylized, not photoreal: this is a Cozy-kit vehicle with a simplified pastel palette.",
      "Wheels are separate objects pivoted on their hubs, so they can be rolled; the body itself is not rigged.",
      "Interior is simplified; not suitable for a close-up cabin shot."
    ],
